  "solution": {
    "text": "From the given ray diagram shown in the figure below <math><msub><mrow><mi>&#956;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>&#956;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>r</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>r</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math><br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/mwepkaesbjnmtfynplaxgwdmrwdqtpdssugudxffasfxvgkbkz.png\" /><br /><br />In <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;MNP</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />From the geometry of the figure<br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>R</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>R</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><